cloudai-x/threejs-skills carries no LICENSE file. Its README states the terms,
and this is that statement, quoted verbatim from README.md at commit
b1c623076c661fc9b03dac19292e825a5d106823:

    ## License

    MIT License - Feel free to use, modify, and distribute.

The same README's "Installation" section directs users to "Clone this
repository into your project or copy the `.claude/skills` directory", which is
what .claude/skills/threejs-* is.
